  "body": "Welcome to a home that truly understands modern family living. Positioned on a sunny corner site, this brand-new 5-bedroom, 3-bathroom residence combines high-end design with a flexible layout that’s hard to find. With two distinct entrances, it’s an ideal setup for multi-generational living or those who simply value their own space.\r\n\r\nThe Main Living Area\r\n• The master bedroom: a private, sun-filled retreat with a walk-in wardrobe and a sleek ensuite\r\n• Two additional bedrooms, serviced by a contemporary family bathroom\r\n• A stunning open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area filled with natural light, flowing seamlessly to a sun-drenched deck and garden, perfect for weekend BBQs and entertaining\r\n• An elegant, spacious designer kitchen featuring a large walk-in pantry, a grand island bench, and ample cupboard space\r\n\r\nGranny Potential Area\r\n• Own private front entrance for complete separation\r\n• Two bedrooms, a living lounge, and a full bathroom, offering true independence\r\n• A large storage room with built-in cabinetry, which could also serve as a potential kitchenette\r\n\r\nSet on a generous section, this home offers ample off-street parking, plenty of room for multiple vehicles, a caravan, or a boat. You’ll also find under-roof storage for added practicality.\r\n\r\nLocated in Millwater, you’re part of a family-friendly community. Local schools, parks, and cafes are all within easy reach, with motorway access nearby for a smooth commute.\r\n\r\nThis is a home that offers more than just space, it offers flexibility and lifestyle. Don’t miss out, contact us today to arrange a viewing or attend our Open Home!",
